span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/declval\"><span class=\"kw1128\">std::<span class=\"me2\">declval</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_alias_template\">Helper alias template</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-ranges\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br><span class=\"kw1\">using</span> difference_type_t <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difference_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-ranges-ts t-mark-ts\">(ranges TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/iterator/WeaklyIncrementable\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>WeaklyIncrementable</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specifies that a <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/concepts/Semiregular\"><code>Semiregular</code></a> type can be incremented with pre- and post-increment operators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(concept)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iterato